WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.949
We are once again partnering
with our good pals at AT&amp;T

00:00:02.949 --> 00:00:05.628
this time to bring you a one hour pre-show

00:00:05.628 --> 00:00:09.088
live from the roof of the
glorious Spreckels Theater.

00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:11.997
It's called Conan 360 Live.

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:15.957
It is broadcast entirely in
360 degree virtual reality,

00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:17.565
and hosted by very funny comedians

00:00:17.565 --> 00:00:19.717
Chris Redd and Moses Storm.

00:00:19.717 --> 00:00:23.334
Andy's wearing a VR
headset so we can say hi.

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:24.834
Do you see Chris and Moses, Andy?

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:25.667
I do.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:26.500
There they are!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.024
They're right in front of me,
it's like I can touch them.

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:29.424
[Conan] Yeah, they're
on the rooftop right now

00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:30.594
and I think there they are.

00:00:30.594 --> 00:00:31.427
Yes, yes.

00:00:31.427 --> 00:00:34.653
(audience cheering)

00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:35.653
Hey Conan.

00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:38.835
Hey, I don't know where I'm at.

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:39.824
This is beautiful.

00:00:39.824 --> 00:00:40.963
Yeah, it's beautiful.

00:00:40.963 --> 00:00:42.808
What a sad set we built for them.

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:44.413
(audience laughing)

00:00:44.413 --> 00:00:45.593
Conan do you like our set?

00:00:45.593 --> 00:00:49.760
Yeah, it's a rejected
outhouse from Jurassic Park.

00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:54.099
It's really more of an encampment.

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:55.291
[Conan] I know.

00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:57.331
We're sorry guys, but
you're doing a great job,

00:00:57.331 --> 00:00:59.539
and guess what, our Conan 360, oh look,

00:00:59.539 --> 00:01:01.230
there was some AT&amp;T signage there.

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.471
Andy, don't accidentally
look down and see that.

00:01:03.471 --> 00:01:05.060
Oh my goodness.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.263
[Andy] Where are my legs?

00:01:06.263 --> 00:01:09.006
(audience laughing)

00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:10.462
They took my legs!

00:01:10.462 --> 00:01:12.043
(audience laughing)

00:01:12.043 --> 00:01:14.195
Guess what, our Conan 360 Live pre-show

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:15.772
has three other cameras.

00:01:15.772 --> 00:01:17.264
We got stage door.

00:01:17.264 --> 00:01:18.595
That's right, stage door.

00:01:18.595 --> 00:01:20.194
There it is, yeah pretty amazing.

00:01:20.194 --> 00:01:21.027
(audience cheering)

00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:22.030
You don't see that every day.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.683
Turn around Andy!

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.770
[Andy] You don't know it
but you're on TV right now.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.862
[Conan] We've got inside the theater!

00:01:27.862 --> 00:01:28.695
Yes!

00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:30.334
(audience cheering)

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:32.563
That's the lobby.

00:01:32.563 --> 00:01:35.155
I guess that's the lobby,
and we have the audience area

00:01:35.155 --> 00:01:36.483
right here where the stage is.

00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:38.512
Let's see that so we
can the next (mumbles).

00:01:38.512 --> 00:01:41.521
(audience cheering)

00:01:41.521 --> 00:01:42.589
Where are they?

00:01:42.589 --> 00:01:45.589
(audience cheering)

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.250
oh yeah.
My legs are still gone!

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.621
You're legs are still there.

00:01:57.621 --> 00:02:00.621
(audience cheering)

00:02:03.771 --> 00:02:04.620
You can watch,

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:05.453
you look like a fool,

00:02:05.453 --> 00:02:06.286
you can watch

00:02:06.286 --> 00:02:07.119
(audience laughing)

00:02:07.119 --> 00:02:08.358
as opposed to me in a this suit.

00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:11.588
You can watch the VR pre-shows
on our team Coco Facebook,

00:02:11.588 --> 00:02:14.733
YouTube channels and at teamcoco.com/360.

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:16.584
Thanks to our pals at AT&amp;T.

00:02:16.584 --> 00:02:18.251
We'll be right back.

